=== Newtypes Sample ===
--- Newtype from int ---
uid=42
rawId=42
--- Newtype from string ---
lbl=hello
rawLabel=hello
--- Newtype from bool ---
flag=True
rawFlag=True
--- Newtype from struct ---
pos.X=3
pos.Y=7
pos.Describe=(3, 7)
--- Newtype from class ---
actor.GetName=Hero
actor.GetId=1
actor.Describe=Entity(Hero, 1)
--- Member access ---
xVal=10
yVal=20
actorName=Villain
actorId=2
--- Explicit casting ---
sourceInt=99
castToNewtype=99
castBack=99
Done!
